---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="BCL School — Join the waitlist"
  description="Applied AI literacy for tradesmen. Founding-25 cohort opening soon. Join the waitlist to claim a seat at founding pricing."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-steel-800 via-steel-900 to-steel-900"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-96 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,theme(colors.volt.500/15),transparent_60%)]"></div>
    <div class="container-wide pt-20 pb-16 md:pt-28 md:pb-20">
      <p class="eyebrow">BCL School · Founding 25 cohort</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05]">
        AI for tradesmen.<br />
        <span class="text-volt-500">No fluff. No CS degree required.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-steel-300">
        A 4-week applied program built by working tradespeople — for the workers, not just the bosses. You ship 5 real AI workflows you can use Monday morning: estimating, ordering, invoicing, customer comms, and shop-defense basics. The first 25 students get founding pricing, weekly office hours with the founders, and lifetime access to every future module.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base text-steel-400">
        Pay for it yourself or get your boss to expense it — either way, you walk out the one who knows it. Free seat every cohort for low-income tradespeople; flag it on the form.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="#waitlist" class="btn-primary">Join the waitlist</a>
        <a href="/programs#teach" class="btn-secondary">See the full Teach pillar →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-wide py-12">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-6">
        <p class="eyebrow">Format</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">4 weeks · self-paced · live calls</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">Pre-recorded modules you watch on the truck or on the couch. One live group call per week. Direct DM access to the founders inside the cohort.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-6">
        <p class="eyebrow">Outcome</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">5 working AI workflows</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">By week 4 you've built and used: an estimator helper, an invoice cleaner, a vendor-callback drill, a phishing-spot checklist, and a voice-first jobsite note-taker.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-6">
        <p class="eyebrow">Founding 25 perks</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">Cheaper, deeper, forever</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">Founding pricing locked in. Weekly office hours with Paul and the team. Lifetime access to every future module BCL ships.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-wide py-12">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Curriculum preview</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">What you'll actually learn</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-volt-500">Week 1</p>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">Spotting fakes — phishing &amp; voice clones</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">Real invoices vs. fake ones. The vendor-callback rule. What a deepfake voicemail sounds like and how to drill your AP person against it.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-volt-500">Week 2</p>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">Estimating with AI without getting burned</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">Walk-through to bid in under an hour. When to trust the AI, when to override it, and what to NEVER paste into a chatbot.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-volt-500">Week 3</p>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">The voice-first day</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">Hands-free jobsite notes. Materials lists from a 30-second voice memo. Customer follow-ups dictated between stops.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-volt-500">Week 4</p>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">Shop hardening &amp; certification</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">SPF/DKIM/DMARC in plain English. MFA rollouts that don't break the office. Final project: pick one workflow, ship it, present it. AI-Ready Tradesman cert.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="waitlist" class="container-wide py-16">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volt-500/30 bg-volt-500/5 p-8 md:p-12">
      <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] md:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Founding 25 waitlist</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Claim a seat.</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-steel-300">No payment yet — just first dibs when enrollment opens. We'll email you the founding pricing, the start date, and a one-question screener to make sure the cohort is a fit.</p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-steel-300">
            <li>• 25 seats. First-come, first-served.</li>
            <li>• Founding price locked in for life.</li>
            <li>• Free seat for low-income tradespeople — flag it on the form.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <form
          name="school-waitlist"
          method="POST"
          action="/.netlify/functions/waitlist"
          class="grid gap-4"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="school-waitlist" />
          <input type="hidden" name="source" value="/school" />
          <p class="hidden" aria-hidden="true"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></p>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Name</span>
            <input
              type="text"
              name="name"
              required
              autocomplete="name"
              placeholder="First and last"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 placeholder:text-steel-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            />
          </label>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Email</span>
            <input
              type="email"
              name="email"
              required
              autocomplete="email"
              placeholder="you@yourshop.com"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 placeholder:text-steel-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            />
          </label>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Trade</span>
            <select
              name="trade"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            >
              <option value="">Pick one…</option>
              <option value="electrical">Electrical</option>
              <option value="plumbing">Plumbing</option>
              <option value="hvac">HVAC</option>
              <option value="carpentry">Carpentry / framing</option>
              <option value="general">General contracting</option>
              <option value="mechanical">Mechanical / auto</option>
              <option value="landscaping">Landscaping / hardscape</option>
              <option value="roofing">Roofing</option>
              <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Shop size</span>
            <select
              name="shop_size"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            >
              <option value="">Pick one…</option>
              <option value="1">1 (just me)</option>
              <option value="2-5">2–5</option>
              <option value="6-15">6–15</option>
              <option value="16-50">16–50</option>
              <option value="50+">50+</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Biggest AI question right now</span>
            <textarea
              name="biggest_question"
              rows="3"
              placeholder="Optional. e.g., 'how do I stop my AP person falling for fake invoice emails?'"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 placeholder:text-steel-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            ></textarea>
          </label>

          <label class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-steel-300">
            <input
              type="checkbox"
              name="needs_subsidy"
              value="yes"
              class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 rounded border-steel-600 bg-steel-900 text-volt-500 focus:ring-volt-500/60"
            />
            <span>I'd like to be considered for a grant-subsidized free seat. (No proof required at this stage.)</span>
          </label>

          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary mt-2">Join the waitlist</button>
          <p class="text-xs text-steel-400">We'll never sell your email. Unsubscribe whenever.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
